<title>EGYPT: National Spinning full-yr losses rise.</title>
<headline>National Spinning full-yr losses rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Spinning and Weaving made net losses of 78.049 million pounds in the financial year 1995/6, after losses of 54.693 million pounds in the previous year, an official source at the Public Enterprise Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The financial year ends on June 30.</p>
<p>The losses, which are not audited, are equivalent to 2.95 pounds for each of the 26.415 million shares, which last traded on the Egyptian stock exchange at 2.70 pounds.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
